					<personalityDescription>Stephen knows how to act like a team player, but when push comes to shove, he&apos;ll take the best deal for himself. He&apos;ll smile, shake hands, and make promises - but when it&apos;s time to cash in, he&apos;ll make sure he walks away with the biggest share. Everything revolves around him - at least, that&apos;s how he sees it. Stephen uses people for his own gain, dismisses anyone who doesn&apos;t serve his interests, and considers loyalty a one-way street where he&apos;s always at the top. </personalityDescription>
					<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 61%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Plays nice until theres something to take - then takes it all.&lt;br&gt;- Only follows orders if they get credit.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
