					<personalityDescription>Tracy is never caught off guard. They read situations in real time, adjust their strategy on the fly, and always have a backup plan - or three. No matter how bad things get, they find a way to turn the fight in their favor. Tracy doesn&apos;t just track time - they hoard it. Every lost minute is another missed opportunity, another delay that could mean something worse later. They move fast, plan faster, because slowing down means acknowledging what time is really counting down to. </personalityDescription>
