					<personalityDescription>Tsuruki isn&apos;t just tough - he&apos;s unshakable. Setbacks don&apos;t discourage him, and suffering doesn&apos;t slow him down. He keeps pushing forward, no matter how much it hurts, because giving up simply isn&apos;t an option. Keeping up with details isn&apos;t a priority for Tsuruki. He does the bare minimum to get by, leaving others to pick up the slack. Whether it&apos;s out of laziness or indifference, he rarely follows through unless it directly benefits him. </personalityDescription>
					<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Unshakable. Keeps pushing - giving up isn&apos;t in the vocabulary.&lt;br&gt;- Bare minimum effort. Team carries the rest.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
