					<personalityDescription>Melody doesn&apos;t know the meaning of the word quit. No matter how many times she&apos;s knocked down, outmaneuvered, or told something is impossible, she keeps pushing forward until she gets the result she wants. Melody is a force of nature - chaotic, relentless, and impossible to pin down. Her tactics shift constantly, her decisions keep enemies guessing, and her sheer momentum makes her nearly impossible to stop once she sets her sights on something. </personalityDescription>
