					<personalityDescription>Nadim doesn&apos;t waste time on altruism - every deal, every alliance, every action is about securing his own advantage. If helping someone else happens to benefit him too, all the better - but if it doesn&apos;t, he won&apos;t waste a second thought on them. Nadim doesn&apos;t coddle - he drives people forward. His words are sharp, his expectations high, but it&apos;s all to make sure those around him survive. If he&apos;s hard on someone, it&apos;s because he refuses to let them fail. </personalityDescription>
					<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Won&apos;t lift a finger unless it pays out.&lt;br&gt;- Pushes hard, expects more - pressure makes diamonds.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
