					<personalityDescription>Chris doesn&apos;t see the point in fighting for a bigger slice of the pie when he&apos;s already got enough to get by. Others can stress over promotions and prestige - he&apos;ll take his time, do what&apos;s necessary, and enjoy life without all the extra pressure. Chris&apos;s presence alone is enough to lift spirits. His confidence is contagious, his words ignite courage, and his actions prove that even against impossible odds, there&apos;s always a way forward. </personalityDescription>
