					<personalityDescription>Kimberly has a knack for making things work. Give her a scrap heap, and she&apos;ll build a functioning &apos;Mek. Give her a bad deal, and she&apos;ll flip it for a profit. She thrives in chaos, always finding ways to turn nothing into something. Kimberly knows that persuasion isn&apos;t just about words - it&apos;s about presence. A well-timed silence, a knowing look, a carefully measured response - all of it works together to make sure, by the end of the conversation, she gets exactly what she wants. </personalityDescription>
