					<personalityDescription>If Alfons&apos;s doing something, everyone is going to know about it. He doubles down on every decision, throws himself into everything at full speed, and refuses to settle for anything that isn&apos;t over-the-top. Alfons says what he means and means what he says. He doesn&apos;t believe in playing games or sugarcoating the truth - his words and actions come from a place of honesty, making him a rare presence in a world full of deception. </personalityDescription>
