					<personalityDescription>Ossnain&apos;s instincts are razor-sharp. He can smell a bad deal before it&apos;s offered, spot a bluff before it&apos;s played, and turn a negotiation into a masterclass in getting exactly what he wants. Ossnain has hidden stockpiles everywhere. Rations in the storage bay, extra weapons in unmarked crates, an escape route planned for any disaster. People think he&apos;s paranoid - until the first real crisis hits. &quot;What do you mean you didn&apos;t pack three months&apos; worth of emergency food?&quot; </personalityDescription>
