					<personalityDescription>Zoie doesn&apos;t waste time on sentiment - she does what it takes to win. Morality, loyalty, and fairness are just obstacles, and she has no patience for those too weak to do what&apos;s necessary. Zoie refuses to acknowledge limits - her own or anyone else&apos;s. She constantly takes on more than she should, convinced that sheer willpower and stubbornness will carry her through, even as the cracks begin to show. </personalityDescription>
