					<personalityDescription>Once Basuki commits to something, that&apos;s the end of the discussion. No argument, no persuasion, no force in the universe is enough to shake his resolve once he&apos;s made up his mind. Nothing satisfies Basuki for long. He hoards wealth, demands more, and always looks for the next deal, the next scheme, the next way to expand his fortune - no matter the cost to those around him. </personalityDescription>
