					<personalityDescription>Eni doesn&apos;t leave anything to chance. They analyze, adapt, and execute with precision, always thinking three steps ahead to ensure they control the game rather than being a piece in it. Eni doesn&apos;t just use finger guns ironically - they fully commit to them. Affirmation? Finger guns. Acknowledgment? Finger guns. Encouragement? Double finger guns with a nod for extra effect. </personalityDescription>
