					<personalityDescription>Joe has an uncanny ability to turn even the worst situations into financial gain. Whether it&apos;s salvaging wrecks, flipping assets, or cutting deals in the middle of chaos, he always ensures he walks away richer than he started. Joe keeps physical copies of manuals even when digital versions are readily available. He has a personal archive of reference materials for everything - even things he doesn&apos;t personally work with. &quot;You never know when you&apos;ll need to troubleshoot an emergency oxygen scrubber,&quot; he insists. </personalityDescription>
