					<personalityDescription>Abdul-Aziz acts on instinct, rarely stopping to consider the consequences before charging ahead. Whether on the battlefield or in conversation, he prefers action over hesitation - sometimes to his own detriment. Abdul-Aziz&apos;s presence alone is enough to lift spirits. His confidence is contagious, his words ignite courage, and his actions prove that even against impossible odds, there&apos;s always a way forward. </personalityDescription>
