					<personalityDescription>Ashley doesn&apos;t just do things - they master them. Their skill and precision make even the most complex tasks seem simple, setting them apart as someone who truly knows their craft. Ashley puts on a friendly face, but it&apos;s a survival tactic as much as anything. They know being likable keeps people from turning on them, but deep down, they&apos;re always waiting for the moment when trust becomes a liability. </personalityDescription>
					<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 43%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Precision operator - knows the tools, knows the timing.&lt;br&gt;- Knows every name, every story. Makes people feel like they matter.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
