					<personalityDescription>Mu&apos;awiyah&apos;s appetite for pleasure is as boundless as his ambition. Whether it&apos;s the thrill of the chase, the rush of conquest, or the warmth of fleeting intimacy, he indulges in life&apos;s vices without hesitation or regret. Mu&apos;awiyah refuses to abandon his squad, even when it means putting himself in danger. He&apos;s the one diving into enemy fire to pull a comrade out, the one holding the line so others can escape. &quot;You go,&quot; he says, standing firm. &quot;I&apos;ll make sure they don&apos;t follow you.&quot; </personalityDescription>
					<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats vice like victory. Always hunting the next high.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
