					<personalityDescription>Paterno doesn&apos;t stop - ever. Even when reason, exhaustion, or sheer survival say he should walk away, he grits his teeth and keeps going. He&apos;ll finish what he started, even if it kills him. Paterno isn&apos;t loud about his kindness, but it&apos;s there. A quiet word of encouragement, a favor done without asking for thanks, or a small sacrifice to make someone&apos;s life easier - he pays attention to what people need and acts on it, whether they notice or not. </personalityDescription>
					<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Pushes past sense and safety. Finishes what they start, or dies trying.&lt;br&gt;- Helps without being asked. Quiet kind - the kind that keeps units together.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
