					<personalityDescription>Some people accept their place in the universe - Tony refuses to. He dreams big, fights hard, and never stops striving for something greater, no matter how distant or impossible it may seem. Tony knows the war doesn&apos;t guarantee survival. But his decals? They might last longer than he does. Maybe someone will see them one day, wonder who he was, what he fought for. Maybe that&apos;s enough. Maybe that&apos;s all anyone can really hope for. </personalityDescription>
