					<personalityDescription>Hamal refuses to let hardship define him. He&apos;s weathered every storm life has thrown at him, adapting, enduring, and proving that no amount of pain or pressure can break his will. Survival depends on knowing when to listen. Hamal watches, absorbs, and learns from everything around him, filtering out noise and focusing only on what will keep him ahead of the game. </personalityDescription>
