					<personalityDescription>Dallas refuses to waver, no matter the odds. Once they set a goal, they see it through with unshakable determination, standing firm even when everything around them is falling apart. Dallas doesn&apos;t slow down, doesn&apos;t stop, doesn&apos;t rest. Whether in battle, in business, or in pursuit of power, they demand more - more resources, more control, more everything - because anything less feels like losing. </personalityDescription>
