					<personalityDescription>Darren can sell a rusted-out &apos;Mek for triple its value and walk away smiling. They spin stories, plays up their credentials, and always has an answer ready when someone starts asking too many questions. By the time people realize they&apos;ve been had, they&apos;re long gone. Darren fills the silence because silence means thinking. And thinking means remembering. And remembering means realizing how bad things really are. So instead, they just keep talking. About anything. Because if they stop, what&apos;s left? </personalityDescription>
