					<personalityDescription>Antti always has a target in mind, and he won&apos;t stop until he reaches it. Every move he makes is another step toward his objective, and he doesn&apos;t waste time on anything that doesn&apos;t get him closer to success. Antti doesn&apos;t just complain - he fixes things. If something isn&apos;t up to his personal standard, he&apos;ll redo it from scratch. &quot;Look, I don&apos;t trust anyone else to do it right. Just let me handle it before I lose my mind.&quot; </personalityDescription>
