					<personalityDescription>Maria isn&apos;t content with where she is - her eyes are always on the horizon. She sees every challenge as a stepping stone, every setback as a lesson, all leading toward the future she&apos;s determined to claim. Maria can&apos;t control the war. She can&apos;t stop people from dying. But she can make sure her knife is sharp. Every pass of the stone, every adjustment to the angle - it&apos;s something tangible, something real, something that won&apos;t fail her. Because in a universe where everything else falls apart, at least her blade will always be ready. </personalityDescription>
