					<personalityDescription>Mary doesn&apos;t care what people think of her. Whether she&apos;s bragging, bending the truth, or cutting corners, she does what she wants without hesitation or embarrassment. No matter how bad things get, Mary insists that it&apos;s not that bad - sometimes to the frustration of everyone else. &quot;Sure, everything&apos;s broken, the situation is dire, and we&apos;re completely unprepared, but think of the upside!&quot; </personalityDescription>
