					<personalityDescription>Caution is for those who expect to live forever, and Liane has no such illusions. She charges into the most dangerous situations with unwavering resolve, knowing that fortune - and survival - favors only those bold enough to seize it. Liane isn&apos;t just thinking ahead - she&apos;s willing to burn down the present to create the future she envisions. She pursues her ideals with relentless conviction, and if others can&apos;t see the brilliance of her plan, they&apos;re just obstacles to be removed. </personalityDescription>
					<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Accepts danger as part of the job. Charges forward with purpose, not illusion.&lt;br&gt;- Will torch the now to build the future. Cold fire in the bones.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
