					<personalityDescription>Mi-gan knows where she wants to be, and she knows how to get there. With a mix of charm, strategy, and just the right amount of risk-taking, she maneuvers her way toward success, making the right allies and cutting loose the dead weight as needed. Mi-gan approaches every fight with precision, analyzing the battlefield and making calculated moves. She doesn&apos;t waste effort on flashy maneuvers - every action serves a purpose, every shot is deliberate. </personalityDescription>
