					<personalityDescription>Some call it bravery, others call it stubbornness, but Faradur simply sees it as doing what needs to be done. No matter the stakes, no matter the danger, He refuses to take a step back when it matters most. Faradur knows exactly how to turn on the charm, and he&apos;s not shy about using it. Whether it&apos;s smooth talk, playful banter, or lingering glances, he thrives on attraction and never passes up an opportunity for a little fun. </personalityDescription>
