					<personalityDescription>Millard believes he&apos;s meant for something more, and every battle, every mission, every hard-earned victory is a step toward proving it. Even when the odds are against him, he refuses to stop striving for the future he knows he can reach. Millard isn&apos;t just skilled - he&apos;s honed. Every lesson was learned the hard way, every scar a reminder of a mistake he won&apos;t make twice. In a world where the weak don&apos;t last, Millard&apos;s expertise is the only thing keeping him alive. </personalityDescription>
