					<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no telling what Dana will do next, and that&apos;s what makes them dangerous. Their moods swing wildly, their plans shift without warning, and their reactions can be as destructive to their allies as they are to their enemies. Dana writes down every name, every alias, every legend. They know too many people disappear in this war - vanish from the records, lost to time. They refuse to let that happen. If they have to be the last one who remembers, so be it. </personalityDescription>
