					<personalityDescription>Allison&apos;s patience is razor-thin, and it shows. Every delay, every misstep, every pointless conversation feels like nails on a chalkboard. She doesn&apos;t have time for nonsense - just get to the point and do the job right. Allison isn&apos;t just prepared - she&apos;s ready for everything. Because she&apos;s seen what happens when people aren&apos;t. The last time someone forgot to check their equipment, they didn&apos;t come back. The last time a lance got sloppy, they left a graveyard behind. She won&apos;t make those mistakes. She can&apos;t afford to. </personalityDescription>
