					<personalityDescription>Caution is for the weak, and Show-Mei has no patience for it. She charges headlong into the most dangerous situations with reckless abandon, trusting skill and sheer audacity to carry her through - because hesitation gets people killed. Show-Mei doesn&apos;t believe in sharing, trusting, or sacrificing for others. The universe is cruel, and only those who look out for themselves survive. If someone expects her to stick her neck out for them, they&apos;re in for a rude awakening. </personalityDescription>
					<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Rejects caution. Relies on audacity and instinct. High survivability or quick death.&lt;br&gt;- Trusts no one, helps no one, and always walks away richer.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
