					<personalityDescription>To Michal, war is not just combat - it&apos;s carnage. He revels in the destruction, smashing through enemies with ruthless efficiency and leaving behind nothing but fire, twisted metal, and silence. Michal doesn&apos;t just think he&apos;s invincible - he acts like it. He takes unnecessary risks, dismisses warnings, and underestimates opponents, convinced that sheer skill (or luck) will always pull him through. One day, it won&apos;t. </personalityDescription>
					<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Revels in destruction. Turns battlefields into graveyards with ruthless joy.&lt;br&gt;- Ignores danger, overestimates skill. One day, luck will run out.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
