					<personalityDescription>Toshiyuki always has a plan - or three. He&apos;s constantly thinking ahead, setting up contingencies, and maneuvering people and situations to ensure he comes out on top without taking unnecessary risks. Toshiyuki tracks every supply shipment, fuel order, and ration count with precision - yet somehow, he always forgets to eat himself. It&apos;s not uncommon to find him gnawing on a stale protein bar at 3 AM while recalculating fuel logistics, as if he just remembered that human beings require sustenance. </personalityDescription>
					<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 34%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Plans within plans. Never moves without bait.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
