					<personalityDescription>Attis doesn&apos;t waste time on distractions. He measures success not by effort but by results, constantly driving forward with a clear vision of where he&apos;s going and how he&apos;ll get there. Attis&apos;s loyalty is measured in cash, and the only flag he follows is the one that pays him the most. If the contract is right, he&apos;ll fight for anyone, against anyone - principles be damned. </personalityDescription>
