					<performanceExamScore>48</performanceExamScore>
					<personalityDescription>The line between confidence and recklessness is one Iestyn never bothers to acknowledge. He acts on impulse, ignores warnings, and barrels forward at full speed, trusting that he&apos;ll figure things out before it&apos;s too late. Nothing slows Iestyn down - not exhaustion, not setbacks, not even failure. He grinds forward, refusing to accept defeat, because in his mind, stopping is just another way of dying. </personalityDescription>
					<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t care if it&apos;s reckless - just that it&apos;s fast and loud.&lt;br&gt;- Keeps grinding, no matter the setback. Refuses to quit.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
