					<performanceExamScore>35</performanceExamScore>
					<personalityDescription>Artur notices the details others miss - the flicker of movement in the distance, the shift in tone during negotiations. They stay sharp, ready to act at a moment&apos;s notice, because the one time they aren&apos;t prepared might be the last. Artur remembers battle tactics, enemy weak points, and how to compensate for environmental conditions perfectly. But ask them what day it is? Who they&apos;re fighting this week? Whether they ate before a mission? Gone. Their mind is laser-focused on combat, but the second they get back to base, they&apos;re back to asking, &quot;Wait, what planet is this again?&quot; </personalityDescription>
					<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 34%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Catches what others miss. Operates on constant edge-readiness.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
