					<performanceExamScore>45</performanceExamScore>
					<personalityDescription>Milos&apos;s got a talent for finding loopholes, exploiting technicalities, and twisting situations to his advantage. If someone assumed he&apos;d play fair, that&apos;s on them - he never promised to play by the rules. Milos&apos;s trash talk isn&apos;t cruel - it&apos;s just how he interacts. If he&apos;s not making fun of you, it&apos;s probably a bad sign. &quot;Oh, you actually got it right this time? Guess miracles do happen.&quot; </personalityDescription>
					<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Slips through cracks and loopholes like it&apos;s a game.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
